{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Salt VS Pepper - an (actually) addictive twin-stick shooter</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by snappy Flash games, <strong>Salt VS Pepper</strong> is a chaotic twin-stick shooter/bullet hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/f82850bd4ac0651074eb85a4f02b727c.poster.avif?t=1772319229\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/f82850bd4ac0651074eb85a4f02b727c.webm?t=1772319229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/f82850bd4ac0651074eb85a4f02b727c.mp4?t=1772319229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>You can't stop shifting!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift between black and white realities every 3 seconds while leaving behind a clone!<br><strong><i>Note: The &quot;flashing&quot; is slower in the actual game, and is not as annoying as it seems. It can also be disabled.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/c087ea2d7d6168f9463b9486edf57960.poster.avif?t=1772319229\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/c087ea2d7d6168f9463b9486edf57960.webm?t=1772319229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/c087ea2d7d6168f9463b9486edf57960.mp4?t=1772319229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Weapons? Sort of!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 5 shifts, you'll be given a new weapon... Well, maybe not a <i>weapon</i>, but that doesn't mean it can't be <i>weaponized!</i>\u00a0Can you survive the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/fcdee1b2f6eaf05b5ee5055a79813353.poster.avif?t=1772319229\" aria-label=\"gameplay footage with 4 players\" width=1170 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/fcdee1b2f6eaf05b5ee5055a79813353.webm?t=1772319229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/fcdee1b2f6eaf05b5ee5055a79813353.mp4?t=1772319229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Die with your friends!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in local co-op with up to 4 players! Try to survive while you <i>almost</i>\u00a0have no idea what's going on. <i>Almost</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real winner is <strong>not</strong> friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/e178ede810f268515d5e49e43b15b1ec.poster.avif?t=1772319229\" width=1170 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/e178ede810f268515d5e49e43b15b1ec.webm?t=1772319229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/extras/e178ede810f268515d5e49e43b15b1ec.mp4?t=1772319229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Did you wishlist it yet??</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many guns and items (More are added all the time!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool interactions between items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shift and get cloned every 3 seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a new weapon every 5 shifts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More game modes and features are on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All current features will be included in the upcoming demo as well. Enjoy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928310?t=1772319229","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/6eab7696e4b473d44e4008bcc8b2f6508366ee43/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772319229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/bd9b44693e3505ec1c1586067c2ce09964f41b6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772319229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928310/bd9b44693e3505ec1c1586067c2ce09964f41b6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772319229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"C